  "\"If I do not survive,",
  " Zeon will be lost.\"",
  "\"After we surrender, what of me?\"",
  "\"You'll return in a prisoner swap.\"",
  "\"Yes, sir.\"",
  "\"Ready a ship.\"",
  "\"At once.\"",
  "Even with their MS abandoned,",
  "the fight between Amuro and Char",
  "went on.",
  "\"Char ought to",
  " know it too,\"",
  "\"that the one he really must beat",
  " is the Zabi family.",
  " And still he gets in my way.\"",
  "\"Char, you're here.\"",
  "\"...As I am now, I might be able",
