  "\"I can sense the Zabis' leader.\"",
  "\"That power may well",
  " have been Lalah's gift to you.",
  " You should be grateful.\"",
  "\"You're the one who dragged",
  " Lalah into the fighting.\"",
  "\"If that's what you can't forgive,",
  " you're mistaken, Amuro-kun.\"",
  "\"Wh-what?\"",
  "\"If there had been no war,",
  " Lalah would never have",
  " awakened as a Newtype.\"",
  "\"That's just sophistry!\"",
  "\"But it's the right way to see it.\"",
  "\"Come any closer and I'll shoot.\"",
  "\"Right now, a Newtype",
  " like you is too dangerous.\"",
  "\"I will kill you.\"",
  "\"Why? Because you",
  " are the strongest soldier.\"",
  "\"Isn't the real enemy",
  " the Zabi family?\"",
  "\"Not to me.\"",
  "\"...Is that what Lalah wanted?\"",
  "\"...\"",
  "\"Tch!\"",
  "\"Do you see?",
  " Why I lured you in here?\"",
  "\"Because I figured a Newtype,",
  " when it comes to his body,",
  " is like anyone else.\"",
  "\"Yes, physical skills,",
  " even for a Newtype,",
  " take training.\"",
  "\"Some logic that is.\"",
  "\"Wha--\"",
  "\"J-just now, Lalah said it...\"",
  "\"Newtypes",
  " aren't tools for",
  " k-killing each other.\"",
  "\"In battle they're mighty weapons.",
  " It can't be helped.\"",
  "\"You're a Newtype",
  " yourself, aren't you?",
  " You must have heard it.\"",
  "\"That you can hear",
  " that voice too,",
  " I cannot forgive.\"",
  "\"Toppling the Zabis",
  " is a mere afterthought now.\"",
  "\"Once Zeon is gone, the age",
